  {
   "id": "the-case-of-the-golden-idol-166722@1.3.2",
   "gameId": "the-case-of-the-golden-idol-166722",
   "displayName": "Update 1.3.2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-10-20T14:06:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey detectives,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The following issues are addressed in this patch based on player feedback since the release.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hidden phrase checking",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have fixed a rare condition where a phrase may become hidden under another phrase in the inventory. The game now checks phrase positions to make sure that if any phrase overlaps another, it will move that phrase to the next free slot in the inventory.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corrupt save file detection",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve had rare cases where player save files were corrupted by the OS. If the game detects a corrupted save, the player will be invited to visit a helpful savegame repository with instructions on how to recover progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Small fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed typo in Act 2 name \"Cursed Inheritence\" -> Inheritance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Scenario 7 third letter: \"brothehood\" -> \"brotherhood\".",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bracket position in the epilogue brotherhood scroll for Willard Wright. (it previously went out of the paper background)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that you can switch around Alistair and James' surnames in the epilogue third scroll and still be correct.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed that if you are zoomed in, the screen position is broken when you return to the scenario selection screen.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added hyphens to the will text in the 3rd Scenario. Should be “My late sister - your mother - …”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please feel free to let us know your feedback in the discussions or in our Discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
